cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the associated paper and this repository."
title: "Onsite Usable Area Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and figure-generation scripts for the paper "Sizing up
  on-site industrial energy: a parcel-level comparison of usable-area methods."
  Benchmarks two parcel-level usable-area estimators — the NLCD
  land-cover-proportion method and the reV composite exclusion method — for
  ground-mount solar and land-based wind across 305,123 U.S. manufacturing
  parcels.
type: software
